---- MODULE JevsearchJob ----
\* Generated by chart-to-tla.mjs from jevsearch-job.mmd, then extended (skill "Chart to spec", step 3).
\* No code exists yet, so guards and variables come from docs/specs/jevsearch.md
\* (Implementation Decisions). Each comment names the spec section it comes from.
\* State values are ASCII because TLC cannot read non-ASCII strings; the map draws them
\* with the chart's Japanese captions.
EXTENDS Naturals, FiniteSets

VARIABLES
    main,      \* the job's chart state
    optCli,    \* --allow-scrape given on the CLI
    optCfg,    \* scraping allowed in the config file
    queries,   \* normalized queries: {"ja"} or {"ja","en"} (spec: 正規化, 推定: dual search)
    resp,      \* the last RustXNG response per query
    tries,     \* retries used (spec: 1回だけやり直し, 推定)
    called,    \* engine kinds sent to RustXNG via engines=
    partial,   \* unresponsive_engines was not empty
    queryFailed, \* a query still could not connect after its retry while another got results
    ruleTyped, \* results whose type the domain rules decided
    typeAsked, \* results that got a type_rNN question
    jevBody,   \* field names in the body (state) sent to Jev
    stored,    \* result slots written to the result log
    row,       \* the result log row of each slot
    record,    \* the job record's outcome
    keyUse,    \* where the API key was sent
    logged     \* field names written to result log, job record, eval record, and screen

vars == <<main, optCli, optCfg, queries, resp, tries, called, partial, ruleTyped, typeAsked, jevBody, stored, row, record, logged, queryFailed, keyUse>>

\* One representative result per query: slot q holds what query q found.
Q == {"ja", "en"}
Resp == {"unused", "pending", "error", "empty", "results"}
Conf == {"hi", "lo", "none"}
Judg == [val : {"set", "unclassified"}, conf : Conf]
TypeJ == [by : {"rule", "jev"}, val : {"set", "unclassified"}, conf : Conf]
Rec == [hasQuery : BOOLEAN, hasTime : BOOLEAN, type : TypeJ, genre : Judg, rel : Judg]

\* spec: Jev によるまとめて分類 - state holds the query and id, title, url, domain, snippet, engine per result
JevStateFields == {"query", "id", "title", "url", "domain", "snippet", "engine"}
\* spec: 保存 - result log row, job record, eval record (sent state and questions, no key), CLI summary
LogFields == {"job_id", "query", "query_norm", "retrieved_at", "url", "title", "snippet", "engine",
              "published_date", "type", "genre", "relevant", "topic", "versions",
              "outcome", "reasons", "counts", "jev_model", "tokens", "sent_state", "questions"}
AllFields == JevStateFields \cup LogFields \cup {"apikey"}

mainStates == {"Accepted", "Normalizing", "Searching", "Failed", "NoResults", "RuleTagging",
               "JevClassify", "Saved", "PartiallySaved"}
Terminal == {"Failed", "NoResults", "Saved", "PartiallySaved"}

TypeOK ==
    /\ main \in mainStates
    /\ optCli \in BOOLEAN /\ optCfg \in BOOLEAN
    /\ queries \in {{"ja"}, {"ja", "en"}}
    /\ resp \in [Q -> Resp]
    /\ tries \in 0..1
    /\ called \subseteq {"api", "scrape"}
    /\ partial \in BOOLEAN /\ queryFailed \in BOOLEAN
    /\ keyUse \subseteq {"typesafe_auth_header", "jev_state", "log"}
    /\ ruleTyped \subseteq Q /\ typeAsked \subseteq Q
    /\ jevBody \subseteq AllFields
    /\ stored \subseteq Q
    /\ row \in [Q -> Rec]
    /\ record \in {"none", "saved", "partial", "zero", "failed"}
    /\ logged \subseteq AllFields

\* An unwritten slot.
EmptyRow == [hasQuery |-> FALSE, hasTime |-> FALSE,
             type |-> [by |-> "jev", val |-> "unclassified", conf |-> "none"],
             genre |-> [val |-> "unclassified", conf |-> "none"], rel |-> [val |-> "unclassified", conf |-> "none"]]

Got == {q \in Q : resp[q] = "results"}

Init ==
    /\ main = "Accepted"
    /\ optCli \in BOOLEAN /\ optCfg \in BOOLEAN
    /\ queries = {"ja"}
    /\ resp = [q \in Q |-> "unused"]
    /\ tries = 0
    /\ called = {}
    /\ partial = FALSE /\ queryFailed = FALSE
    /\ keyUse = {}
    /\ ruleTyped = {} /\ typeAsked = {}
    /\ jevBody = {}
    /\ stored = {}
    /\ row = [q \in Q |-> EmptyRow]
    /\ record = "none"
    /\ logged = {}

\* 検索を始めた
Start ==
    /\ main = "Accepted" /\ main' = "Normalizing"
    /\ UNCHANGED <<optCli, optCfg, queries, resp, tries, called, partial, ruleTyped, typeAsked, jevBody, stored, row, record, logged, queryFailed, keyUse>>

\* 用語辞書で検索語をそろえ終えた
\* spec: 正規化 - an English query exists only when the dictionary has one (推定: both are searched)
\* spec: 設定 - scrape engines only when both the CLI option and the config allow it (推定: 二重の許可)
Normalized ==
    /\ main = "Normalizing" /\ main' = "Searching"
    /\ \E qs \in {{"ja"}, {"ja", "en"}} :
         /\ queries' = qs
         /\ resp' = [q \in Q |-> IF q \in qs THEN "pending" ELSE "unused"]
    /\ called' = {"api"} \cup (IF optCli /\ optCfg THEN {"scrape"} ELSE {})
    /\ UNCHANGED <<optCli, optCfg, tries, partial, ruleTyped, typeAsked, jevBody, stored, row, record, logged, queryFailed, keyUse>>

\* One attempt asks again only the queries without a normal response.
Attempt(r) ==
    /\ r \in [Q -> Resp]
    /\ \A q \in Q : q \notin queries => r[q] = "unused"
    /\ \A q \in queries : r[q] # "unused" /\ r[q] # "pending"
    /\ \A q \in queries : resp[q] \in {"empty", "results"} => r[q] = resp[q]
AnyError(r) == \E q \in queries : r[q] = "error"

\* 検索エンジンにつながらず、1回だけやり直す
\* spec: 検索の接続口 - つながらない、または HTTP エラー → 1回だけやり直し
Retry ==
    /\ main = "Searching" /\ main' = "Searching"
    /\ tries = 0
    /\ \E r \in [Q -> Resp] : Attempt(r) /\ AnyError(r) /\ resp' = r
    /\ tries' = 1
    /\ UNCHANGED <<optCli, optCfg, queries, called, partial, ruleTyped, typeAsked, jevBody, stored, row, record, logged, queryFailed, keyUse>>

\* やり直しても検索エンジンにつながらず、結果が1件も届かなかった
\* spec: 検索の接続口 - a query still fails after its retry and no query got results → 失敗
FailAfterRetry ==
    /\ main = "Searching" /\ main' = "Failed"
    /\ tries = 1
    /\ \E r \in [Q -> Resp] :
         /\ Attempt(r) /\ AnyError(r) /\ (\A q \in queries : r[q] # "results")
         /\ resp' = r
    /\ record' = "failed"
    /\ logged' = LogFields
    /\ UNCHANGED <<optCli, optCfg, queries, tries, called, partial, ruleTyped, typeAsked, jevBody, stored, row, queryFailed, keyUse>>

\* どのエンジンからも結果が返ってこなかった
\* spec: 検索の接続口 - 正常応答で結果0件 → 0件
GotZero ==
    /\ main = "Searching" /\ main' = "NoResults"
    /\ \E r \in [Q -> Resp] : Attempt(r) /\ (\A q \in queries : r[q] = "empty") /\ resp' = r
    /\ record' = "zero"
    /\ logged' = LogFields
    /\ UNCHANGED <<optCli, optCfg, queries, tries, called, partial, ruleTyped, typeAsked, jevBody, stored, row, queryFailed, keyUse>>

\* 結果が1件以上届いた
GotResults ==
    /\ main = "Searching" /\ main' = "RuleTagging"
    /\ \E r \in [Q -> Resp] :
         /\ Attempt(r) /\ ~AnyError(r) /\ (\E q \in queries : r[q] = "results")
         /\ resp' = r
    /\ partial' \in BOOLEAN
    /\ UNCHANGED <<optCli, optCfg, queries, tries, called, ruleTyped, typeAsked, jevBody, stored, row, record, logged, queryFailed, keyUse>>

\* 一部の検索語は結果が届き、ほかはやり直してもつながらなかった
\* spec: 検索の接続口 - keep the results and end 一部だけ保存
PartialQueries ==
    /\ main = "Searching" /\ main' = "RuleTagging"
    /\ tries = 1
    /\ \E r \in [Q -> Resp] :
         /\ Attempt(r) /\ AnyError(r) /\ (\E q \in queries : r[q] = "results")
         /\ resp' = r
    /\ partial' \in BOOLEAN
    /\ queryFailed' = TRUE
    /\ UNCHANGED <<optCli, optCfg, queries, tries, called, ruleTyped, typeAsked, jevBody, stored, row, record, logged, keyUse>>

\* ドメインで分かる種類を付け終えた
\* spec: ドメイン規則による種類付け - only the URL's domain decides; Jev gets no type question for these
RuleTagDone ==
    /\ main = "RuleTagging" /\ main' = "JevClassify"
    /\ ruleTyped' \in SUBSET Got
    /\ typeAsked' = Got \ ruleTyped'
    /\ UNCHANGED <<optCli, optCfg, queries, resp, tries, called, partial, jevBody, stored, row, record, logged, queryFailed, keyUse>>

\* spec: Jev - choice/noul confidence below the threshold → 未分類
FromJev(c) == [val |-> IF c = "hi" THEN "set" ELSE "unclassified", conf |-> c]
JevType(c) == [by |-> "jev", val |-> IF c = "hi" THEN "set" ELSE "unclassified", conf |-> c]
Unclassified == [val |-> "unclassified", conf |-> "none"]
RuleType == [by |-> "rule", val |-> "set", conf |-> "hi"]

\* spec: 保存 - every row carries the query and retrieved_at
Answered(q, ct, cg, cr) ==
    [hasQuery |-> TRUE, hasTime |-> TRUE,
     type |-> IF q \in ruleTyped THEN RuleType ELSE JevType(ct),
     genre |-> FromJev(cg), rel |-> FromJev(cr)]
\* spec: Jev - on failure every Jev judgment of the request becomes 未分類; rule types stay
NoJev(q) ==
    [hasQuery |-> TRUE, hasTime |-> TRUE,
     type |-> IF q \in ruleTyped THEN RuleType ELSE [by |-> "jev", val |-> "unclassified", conf |-> "none"],
     genre |-> Unclassified, rel |-> Unclassified]

StoreAnswered ==
    /\ stored' = Got
    /\ \E ct, cg, cr \in [Q -> {"hi", "lo"}] :
        row' = [q \in Q |-> IF q \in Got THEN Answered(q, ct[q], cg[q], cr[q]) ELSE EmptyRow]

\* すべての検索語とエンジンが答え、Jev もすべて答えた
\* spec: low confidence alone keeps 保存済み (推定)
AllAnswered ==
    /\ main = "JevClassify" /\ main' = "Saved"
    /\ ~partial /\ ~queryFailed
    /\ jevBody' = JevStateFields
    /\ keyUse' = {"typesafe_auth_header"}
    /\ StoreAnswered
    /\ record' = "saved"
    /\ logged' = LogFields
    /\ UNCHANGED <<optCli, optCfg, queries, resp, tries, called, partial, ruleTyped, typeAsked, queryFailed>>

\* 一部のエンジンか検索語が答えなかった
EnginesPartial ==
    /\ main = "JevClassify" /\ main' = "PartiallySaved"
    /\ partial \/ queryFailed
    /\ jevBody' = JevStateFields
    /\ keyUse' = {"typesafe_auth_header"}
    /\ StoreAnswered
    /\ record' = "partial"
    /\ logged' = LogFields
    /\ UNCHANGED <<optCli, optCfg, queries, resp, tries, called, partial, ruleTyped, typeAsked, queryFailed>>

\* Jev が使えない、または上限を超えたので未分類として残した
\* spec: Jev - 429/529 after retries or a connection error (the body was sent), or the daily limit (nothing sent)
JevUnavailable ==
    /\ main = "JevClassify" /\ main' = "PartiallySaved"
    /\ \/ jevBody' = {} /\ keyUse' = {}
       \/ jevBody' = JevStateFields /\ keyUse' = {"typesafe_auth_header"}
    /\ stored' = Got
    /\ row' = [q \in Q |-> IF q \in Got THEN NoJev(q) ELSE EmptyRow]
    /\ record' = "partial"
    /\ logged' = LogFields
    /\ UNCHANGED <<optCli, optCfg, queries, resp, tries, called, partial, ruleTyped, typeAsked, queryFailed>>

Next == Start \/ Normalized \/ Retry \/ FailAfterRetry \/ GotZero \/ GotResults \/ PartialQueries \/ RuleTagDone
        \/ AllAnswered \/ EnginesPartial \/ JevUnavailable

Spec == Init /\ [][Next]_vars

\* 検索語と取得日時のない結果を保存しない
NeverStoreWithoutQueryOrTime ==
    \A q \in stored : row[q].hasQuery /\ row[q].hasTime

\* 検索語・タイトル・URL・抜粋と、内部のID・ドメイン名・エンジン名以外は Jev に送らない
NeverSendExtraToJev ==
    jevBody \subseteq {"query", "title", "url", "snippet", "id", "domain", "engine"}

\* API キーを、TypeSafe への認証ヘッダー以外に送らない
NeverSendApiKeyOutsideAuthHeader ==
    /\ keyUse \subseteq {"typesafe_auth_header"}
    /\ "apikey" \notin jevBody

\* 確信度がしきい値より低い判定を「分類済み」として保存しない
NeverStoreLowConfidenceAsClassified ==
    \A q \in stored :
        /\ ~(row[q].type.val = "set" /\ row[q].type.conf = "lo")
        /\ \A j \in {row[q].genre, row[q].rel} : ~(j.val = "set" /\ j.conf = "lo")

\* 画面読み取りのエンジンを、オプションを付けていないのに呼ばない
NeverScrapeWithoutOption ==
    "scrape" \in called => optCli

\* 0件を失敗として記録しない
NeverRecordZeroAsFailure ==
    /\ record = "failed" => \E q \in queries : resp[q] = "error"
    /\ (main # "Searching" /\ \A q \in queries : resp[q] = "empty") => record # "failed"

\* 一部のエンジンや Jev が失敗したことを理由に、取れた結果を捨てない
NeverDropFetchedResults ==
    main \in Terminal => Got \subseteq stored

\* ドメイン規則で決まった種類を Jev の答えで上書きしない
NeverOverwriteRuleType ==
    /\ typeAsked \cap ruleTyped = {}
    /\ \A q \in ruleTyped \cap stored : row[q].type = RuleType

\* API キーを結果ログ・記録・画面の表示に出さない
NeverShowApiKey ==
    "apikey" \notin logged

====
